  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模组。用心制作。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃模组。\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于本模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Hide Hands 是一个极简的<strong>客户端</strong>可配置模组，允许你隐藏副手和/或主手。可以设置为始终隐藏，或仅在持有特定物品时隐藏。默认情况下，该模组会在手持火把或不死图腾时隐藏副手，并且空手时会隐藏玩家的手部（除非进行挥动）。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于“原版体验”整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 客户端合集\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>alwaysHideMainHand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值: false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，则始终隐藏主手。若禁用，则仅在持有 hideMainHandWithItems 中定义的物品时隐藏主手。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>alwaysHideEmptyMainHand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值: true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，则当主手为空时始终隐藏。空手挥动时仍会显示。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideMainHandWithItems</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值: \"\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">当 alwaysHideMainHand 禁用时，持有这些物品时将隐藏主手。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>alwaysHideOffhand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值: false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，则始终隐藏副手。若禁用，则仅在持有 hideOffhandWithItems 中定义的物品时隐藏副手。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideOffhandWithItems</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值: \"minecraft:totem_of_undying,minecraft:torch\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">当 alwaysHideOffhand 禁用时，持有这些物品时将隐藏副手。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一张展示手持火把或不死图腾时隐藏副手的 GIF 动图：</strong><br></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hide-hands/a.webp\" alt=\"gif0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"446\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用本模组，只要下载链接仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论功能已关闭，因为我无法在众多独立的模组页面中跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。感谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
